		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  condition dans la creation de la vue]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=439#p439"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><a href="http://docs.postgresqlfr.org/8.3/functions-conditional.html" rel="nofollow">http://docs.postgresqlfr.org/8.3/functi … ional.html</a><br /><a href="http://www.postgresql.org/docs/8.3/interactive/functions-conditional.html" rel="nofollow">http://www.postgresql.org/docs/8.3/inte … ional.html</a></p><p>Avec un exemple assez parlant:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT * FROM test;

 a
---
 1
 2
 3


SELECT a,
       CASE WHEN a=1 THEN &#039;one&#039;
            WHEN a=2 THEN &#039;two&#039;
            ELSE &#039;other&#039;
       END
    FROM test;

 a | case
---+-------
 1 | one
 2 | two
 3 | other</code></pre></div><p>Donc ici un simple CASE nom_colonne WHEN 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END fait l&#039;affaire.</p>]]></content>
